**Goal Model – Multi‑Robot Resource Delivery Mission**

| **Name** | **Text** | **Runtime** | **Goal Type** | **Relation** | **Justification** |
|----------|-----------|--------------|---------------|--------------|--------------------|
| **G1**: Execute Resource Delivery Mission | Carry out the overall mission of collecting required resources from storage and delivering them to the requesting agent at a specified location. | `;` | Perform | AND | The collection phase must finish before the delivery phase can start for each item, therefore the two child goals are executed sequentially. |
| **G2**: Collection Phase | Collect the required resources from storage places. | `FALLBACK((G2.1;G2.2;G2.3),(G2.4;G2.5))` | Perform | AND | All sub‑goals of the collection phase must be achieved; a fallback is used to handle the battery‑low situation. |
| **G3**: Delivery Phase | Deliver the collected resources to the specified location. | `FALLBACK((G3.1;G3.2),(G3.3;G3.4;G3.5))` | Perform | AND | All sub‑goals of the delivery phase must be achieved; a fallback is used to handle the battery‑low situation and possible failure to return to checkpoint. |
| **G2.1**: Navigate to Storage | Navigate to the storage location where resources are found. | `-` | Perform | – | Simple navigation action. |
| **G2.2**: Request Resource | Send request message to storage with precise specification of requested resources. | `-` | Perform | – | Simple communication action. |
| **G2.3**: Wait for Retrieval | Wait until resources are retrieved and ready for pickup. | `-` | Perform | – | Simple waiting action. |
| **G2.4**: Check Battery Low (10 %) | Check if battery level is below 10 % during collection phase. | `-` | Query | – | Battery level is information that must be retrieved before deciding to recharge. |
| **G2.5**: Recharge and Reassign | Recharge battery at recharging station and assign mission to another robot. | `-` | Perform | – | Simple recharge and hand‑over action. |
| **G3.1**: Transport Resource | Transport the resource from storage to the specified destination. | `-` | Perform | – | Simple transport action. |
| **G3.2**: Check Battery Low (30 %) | Check if battery level is below 30 % during delivery phase. | `-` | Query | – | Battery level is information that must be retrieved before deciding to return to checkpoint. |
| **G3.3**: Return to Checkpoint | Return the resource to a checkpoint for safety. | `-` | Perform | – | Simple return action. |
| **G3.4**: Reassign Remaining Task | Assign remaining task to another robot knowing resource position. | `-` | Perform | – | Simple hand‑over action. |
| **G3.5**: Send Alert | Send alert to sector manager if failure to return resource to checkpoint. | `-` | Perform | – | Simple alert action. |

